{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2021-03-24 06:55:00', 'title': "THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. AND JDE PEET'S ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC LIQUID COFFEE PARTNERSHIP", 'text': "ORRVILLE, OHIO AND AMSTERDAM, MARCH 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) AND JDE PEET'S ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TODAY WHICH WILL ALLOW JDE PEET'S TO SUPPORT THE SMUCKER AWAY FROM HOME LIQUID COFFEE BUSINESS WITH PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT, PRODUCTION AND FOODSERVICE EQUIPMENT INNOVATION."}